  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Form the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;graph shown, the ratio of distance to displacement in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> of motion is:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/64836741-4f46-4194-afd0-2e44dc753b80.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 231px;\" /></p>",
